SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792388903
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AChina's growth accelerates as AI export
OL,4,Aboom outweighs domestic weakness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figure is at the bottom end
OL,7,Fof Beijing's annual growth target of
OL,8,F4.5%-5%, which analysts have said gives
OL,9,Fpolicymakers room to address the
OL,10,Fcountry's economic challenges.
OL,12,FWhile exports have helped offset weak
OL,13,Fspending at home, global trade tensions
OL,14,Fand uncertainty over AI investments are
OL,15,Fclouding its outlook.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
