OL,3,ADon't fall for this - how to protect
OL,4,Ayourself from AI scams
OL,5,
OL,6,FBe careful where you buy from, shoppers
OL,7,Fare being warned as criminals use AI to
OL,8,Fsupercharge scams.
OL,10,FSome fraudsters have made websites for
OL,11,Ffake retailers that claim to be
OL,12,Ffamily-owned firms selling quality
OL,13,FUK-made products. Images may show a UK
OL,14,FHigh Street with Union Jack flags in
OL,15,Fshot.
OL,17,FIf you order you're likely to find a
OL,18,Fproduct either never arrives, or is a
OL,19,Fcheap, mass-produced item from a
OL,20,Fcountry such as China, trading
OL,21,Fstandards officers say.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
