OL,3,AManifest: From reality TV to Wembley
OL,4,AArena in one turbulent year
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen I first meet Turkish girl group
OL,7,Fmanifest, we're on a boat cruising down
OL,8,Fthe River Thames.
OL,10,FThe six band members are clutching
OL,11,Funion jack umbrellas as they pose for
OL,12,Fpress photographs and mingle with
OL,13,FBritish pop acts, including
OL,14,FK-pop-trained boyband dearALICE.
OL,16,FNetflix cameras are filming the evening
OL,17,Ffor a six-part documentary. The group
OL,18,Fare in London hoping to build on their
OL,19,Fsuccess in Turkey and reach an
OL,20,Finternational audience.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
